06:49:10.240 --> 06:49:18.330
the tree could degrade into a chain for some
inputs. One such input is a sequence of increasing

06:49:18.330 --> 06:49:24.398
numbers. To avoid this linear complexity,
we've invented balanced binary search trees

06:49:24.398 --> 06:49:33.040
in which the worst case is logarithmic for
all operations, which makes them very appealing.

